# Articles was renamed to Notes (2026-07-01). Preserve old links + citation equity.
# The bare path needs its own rule: the splat pattern only matches paths beneath it.
/articles    /notes         301
/articles/*  /notes/:splat  301

# The coined archetypes retired (2026-07-10): a flatteringly-named category the publication
# awards is a verdict by arrangement. The groupings are the browse now; Graham's two named
# tests (his published procedures, cited) keep their name at /tests; the red-flags list's
# successor is the /flags registers. Permanent — a considered restructuring, like /articles
# above. These live HERE and not in astro.config redirects: a config redirect becomes a worker
# route that imports its destination page module, and these destinations import the data pools
# (~45MB), which would sink them into the worker past scripts/verifyStatic.mjs's ceiling.
# First match wins: the named tests and red-flags before the catch-all splat.
/archetypes/defensive    /tests/defensive   301
/archetypes/defensive/   /tests/defensive   301
/archetypes/net-nets     /tests/net-nets    301
/archetypes/net-nets/    /tests/net-nets    301
/archetypes/red-flags    /flags             301
/archetypes/red-flags/   /flags             301
/archetypes              /groupings         301
/archetypes/*            /groupings         301

# The shelves page merged into the groupings (2026-07-10): one door for the catalog-by-what-it-does.
/businesses     /groupings         301
/businesses/    /groupings         301
